            <summary>
              <span><i class="fas fa-receipt me-2"></i>Your order <span class="text-muted fw-normal" id="osCount"></span></span>
              <span class="os-head"><span id="osHead"></span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down os-chev"></i></span>
